{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（27日）下午1時半左右，深圳灣大橋往深圳方向發生交通意外。 一輛旅遊巴直撞一輛貨櫃車車尾，據報旅遊巴司機腳部被困。救援人員到場時，該司機已脫困，報稱胸口痛；車上兩名女乘客亦不適。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場協助。（facebook「突發馬路車cam大全」截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136310152350142464719328.jpeg/ugMSwlcFUHrL0OZJPDocPv0jaxhuonfCNihxRDYocUQ\"/><figcaption>消防員在場協助。（facebook「突發馬路車cam大全」截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"深圳灣大橋有旅遊巴直撞貨櫃車，車頭陷入貨櫃車車尾。（fb車cam L（香港群組）/ChunHung Li）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136330330752421888759468.jpeg/Jhy1N7V-pgPfl5MKs6YkP82KUb5lLTCsyIRn0siEZ9I\"/><figcaption>深圳灣大橋有旅遊巴直撞貨櫃車，車頭陷入貨櫃車車尾。（fb車cam L（香港群組）/ChunHung Li）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"旅遊巴撞貨櫃車車尾。（facebook「突發馬路車cam大全」截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136309663411736576519327.jpeg/8M884CtdRYzKcAgrJSbrbOeQVyItbkapOaYKfDmmCnw\"/><figcaption>旅遊巴撞貨櫃車車尾。（facebook「突發馬路車cam大全」截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"多部消防車在場協助。（facebook「突發馬路車cam大全」截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136309322855223296287195.jpeg/i06JuN8PfECnFGXUttqSsZQIKhHNM46cwzNpfsMzaX4\"/><figcaption>多部消防車在場協助。（facebook「突發馬路車cam大全」截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"意外現場前方亦停有另一部旅遊巴。（facebook「突發馬路車cam大全」截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136309768042844160697250.jpeg/9OcBHCFB7mC0bXmvvywRxCInUagzJUWTWQm1h1kJtYc\"/><figcaption>意外現場前方亦停有另一部旅遊巴。（facebook「突發馬路車cam大全」截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-27T07:39:28.636286+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":290,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}